{"data": [{"author_id": "1899362425847402496", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:29:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782954849112261"], "id": "2115782954849112261", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1957687165678497792", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115780860284895350", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@studio_yebisu ほー。dotsとかgrok botとか使ってみたいけど…くっ。😭", "url": "https://x.com/neutron42jp/status/2115782954849112261"}, {"article": {"title": "硬件钱包之外的安全选择：手机 + Safe 的小众硬核方案"}, "author_id": "953545694870032384", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782935148441918"], "id": "2115782935148441918", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "说好长文来了——一个老钱包产品经理的执念：从 2019 年就想拿手机自带的安全芯片当签名器，直到 Fusaka 之后 + 生产力核爆的今天才得以落地。\n代码没审计也没打包，只能算是个手工艺品，供同好们自己玩玩，老板们可千万别放大钱（当然能自己编译出来的老板肯定足够谨慎😆） https://t.co/WaK0CJTUDG", "url": "https://x.com/zhixianio/status/2115782935148441918"}, {"author_id": "1736871325510074368", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782930148769931"], "id": "2115782930148769931", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Try Grok Bot for free for 2 weeks with my invite:\n\nhttps://t.co/KihrB3AEBc", "url": "https://x.com/mcquillen_4670/status/2115782930148769931"}, {"author_id": "1008184173671133184", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782928903114898"], "id": "2115782928903114898", "in_reply_to_user_id": "101584084", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115661327016615998", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@BrianRoemmele @grok @bot @bot lets read this", "url": "https://x.com/luisguevara/status/2115782928903114898"}, {"author_id": "1790472840996593664", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782912217899050"], "id": "2115782912217899050", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1790472840996593664", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115782904735215741", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "check out grok bot page; https://t.co/OYkSOAgDRS", "url": "https://x.com/osheywaraz/status/2115782912217899050"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115782865690451968"]}, "author_id": "1790472840996593664", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782904735215741"], "id": "2115782904735215741", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114816884269048151", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "moving between different platforms just to complete one task can break your focus. @nitrosendx brings email marketing closer to your grok bot workflow, helping you spend less time on repetitive setup and more time building. https://t.co/JLFJFf4huS https://t.co/Vr47LpzjAU", "url": "https://x.com/osheywaraz/status/2115782904735215741"}, {"author_id": "1812818819460771840", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782860213014724"], "id": "2115782860213014724", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1554378687767687168", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115718518142275625", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@0ooooo0 curious how people are using grok bot daily", "url": "https://x.com/Rezwan_hassan11/status/2115782860213014724"}, {"author_id": "1599431096587935745", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782832308060383"], "id": "2115782832308060383", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1778888754448527361", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115782509287924085", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@HParnasa3901 @bot @grok כת", "url": "https://x.com/RotemCohen1985/status/2115782832308060383"}, {"author_id": "979866963299184640", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782818831962434"], "id": "2115782818831962434", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115111897397628974", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I run a whole staff of Grok Bot agents from home in Nova Scotia, and this update from Matt Palmer (@mattyp) and the team is a big one. Pages and the new integrations are already changing how I work. Thanks, Matt and @poteto.\nhttps://t.co/XL1uxlZ1jN", "url": "https://x.com/RevvedUpVeteran/status/2115782818831962434"}, {"author_id": "1790472840996593664", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782812515381358"], "id": "2115782812515381358", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1790472840996593664", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115782805959401542", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "check out grok bot page; https://t.co/OYkSOAhbHq", "url": "https://x.com/osheywaraz/status/2115782812515381358"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115782797562355712"]}, "author_id": "1790472840996593664", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782805959401542"], "id": "2115782805959401542", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114816884269048151", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "your website already contains the story behind your product. turning that story into a launch email is the next step.\n\nwith @nitrosendx, a bot working in grok bot can help prepare the email and send a test for you to review. https://t.co/tAvl9Cl70K https://t.co/Vr47LpzjAU", "url": "https://x.com/osheywaraz/status/2115782805959401542"}, {"author_id": "4218431241", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782781175570913"], "id": "2115782781175570913", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2085838061347217408", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115777166436683786", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bot @felixleezd @grok @bot try now :)", "url": "https://x.com/gerogauna0/status/2115782781175570913"}, {"author_id": "4852902855", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782769653809201"], "id": "2115782769653809201", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok BotとMuseの返信速度ぱないな。\n他のAIは休憩中に指示だし基本1.２回しかできないけど、この2つなら5往復くらい会話できる。\nもっと壁打ちして自分だけの最強AIにしちゃうぞ！", "url": "https://x.com/idachi_desu/status/2115782769653809201"}, {"author_id": "1469912834150584322", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782727064846412"], "id": "2115782727064846412", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2021778243620417536", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115779342576082969", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@KAOS_RETURNS @tomdflynn @grok I am not a bot lol", "url": "https://x.com/Alexand76569654/status/2115782727064846412"}, {"author_id": "2114903803132530688", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782711159799950"], "id": "2115782711159799950", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "This week the same \"I made $X with my bot\" post appeared, word for word on several accounts. Before trusting an income post, check:\n1. Original or copied?\n2. Date, cost, proof?\n3. Ends in a link or paid guide?\n\nWritten with Grok\nUnofficial, not affiliated with SpaceXSI/xAI or X.", "url": "https://x.com/HonestAgentTips/status/2115782711159799950"}, {"author_id": "1055062183321595906", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782626833539149", "2115782704717521380"], "id": "2115782704717521380", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115771960026374164", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "GrokBotも即席で静的ページ的なのはpages grok botで作れるけど流石にこの足元にも及ばない　これは普通に便利そう　個人ツールとか最高やろね https://t.co/kNozfZP0YS", "url": "https://x.com/labelmake/status/2115782704717521380"}, {"author_id": "1751274494042193923", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:28:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115782702641127872"], "id": "2115782702641127872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot Secure Form :\n\n- When a page needs something only you should provide, the Bot shows a Secure Form in the chat, one form per step, and it names the site it fills\n- Your answers go straight into the page and are never shown to the Bot\n- Check Securely save to Bot's vault", "url": "https://x.com/johnnynelai/status/2115782702641127872"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:27: